╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: [Bug]: Context compression can split a multi-tool call/result batch and send an invalid provider request                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ## Prerequisites                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ -  I have searched the existing issues and discussions, and this is not a duplicate.                                                            │
│ -  This is a bug, not a usage question.                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Background / Description                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Context compression can split a valid multi-tool assistant message between a tool call and its matching result.                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ I reproduced this on the current `main` branch at commit `1f433fd7ff2b27f9d98f9385779b5c436c6487ee`.                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ A normal Agent run with two tool calls naturally generated one `AssistantMsg` with the following `Msg.content` shape. The block order and IDs   │
│ below are from the real run; only the repeated tool output text is abbreviated:                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```json                                                                                                                                         │
│ [                                                                                                                                               │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "thinking",                                                                                                                         │
│     "id": "fb50b86ab2174054888b74b52850d400"                                                                                                    │
│   },                                                                                                                                            │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "tool_call",                                                                                                                        │
│     "id": "call_00_uER2QtaMLuqheXpzyCT47644",                                                                                                   │
│     "name": "first_long_tool",                                                                                                                  │
│     "input": "{\"value\": \"hello\"}"                                                                                                           │
│   },                                                                                                                                            │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "tool_call",                                                                                                                        │
│     "id": "call_01_BII3hlgWzRcrVWaM7HTk7265",                                                                                                   │
│     "name": "second_long_tool",                                                                                                                 │
│     "input": "{\"value\": \"world\"}"                                                                                                           │
│   },                                                                                                                                            │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "tool_result",                                                                                                                      │
│     "id": "call_00_uER2QtaMLuqheXpzyCT47644",                                                                                                   │
│     "name": "first_long_tool",                                                                                                                  │
│     "output": ["FIRST:hello: ... repeated ..."]                                                                                                 │
│   },                                                                                                                                            │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "tool_result",                                                                                                                      │
│     "id": "call_01_BII3hlgWzRcrVWaM7HTk7265",                                                                                                   │
│     "name": "second_long_tool",                                                                                                                 │
│     "output": ["SECOND:world: ... repeated ..."]                                                                                                │
│   },                                                                                                                                            │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "thinking",                                                                                                                         │
│     "id": "a6b20208e3b34407b8692f14245c2fc8"                                                                                                    │
│   },                                                                                                                                            │
│   {                                                                                                                                             │
│     "type": "text",                                                                                                                             │
│     "id": "70b6fc8e0cc445cd8992ad89d2c4a345",                                                                                                   │
│     "text": "Both tools have been called..."                                                                                                    │
│   }                                                                                                                                             │
│ ]                                                                                                                                               │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ With a reserve budget of 548 tokens, `Agent._split_context_for_compression()` produced:                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```text                                                                                                                                         │
│ to_compress:                                                                                                                                    │
│ thinking, call1, call2, result1                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ to_reserve:                                                                                                                                     │
│ result2, thinking, text                                                                                                                         │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The compression request therefore contains two tool calls but only the result for the first call. A strict OpenAI-compatible provider rejects   │
│ the request before AgentScope can update `state.context`.                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Expected behavior                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - Context compression should never split matching tool calls and results.                                                                       │
│ - If a complete multi-tool batch cannot fit in the reserve budget, the complete batch should be moved to the compressed side.                   │
│ - Both the compression request and the reserved context should remain valid.                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Root cause                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The current boundary adjustment is performed only once.                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Starting from a boundary after `call1`, it detects that `result1` is unmatched in the reserved suffix and moves the boundary through `result1`. │
│ This also moves `call2` to the compressed side while leaving `result2` reserved, creating a new unmatched pair that is not checked again:       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```text                                                                                                                                         │
│ Original:                                                                                                                                       │
│ call1, call2, result1, result2                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Initial boundary:                                                                                                                               │
│ call1 | call2, result1, result2                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ After the one-pass adjustment:                                                                                                                  │
│ call1, call2, result1 | result2                                                                                                                 │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ This is an independently reproducible context-compression bug. I am not claiming that it is the root cause of the separately reported #2067.    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Error Messages                                                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```shell                                                                                                                                        │
│ BadRequestError: Error code: 400 - {                                                                                                            │
│   'error': {                                                                                                                                    │
│     'message': "An assistant message with 'tool_calls' must be followed by tool messages responding to each 'tool_call_id'. (insufficient tool  │
│ messages following tool_calls message)",                                                                                                        │
│     'type': 'invalid_request_error',                                                                                                            │
│     'param': None,                                                                                                                              │
│     'code': 'invalid_request_error'                                                                                                             │
│   }                                                                                                                                             │
│ }                                                                                                                                               │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
